WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:03.560
Imagine, for a moment, that you are a teenager.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.230
According to our viewership analytics, some
of you watching this won’t have to imagine

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.849
very hard, but some of you will have to really
stretch your mind to remember what that time

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:12.849
was like.

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:16.470
Either way, put yourself in the shoes of an
adolescent for a little while.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:21.560
You’re anxious and uncomfortable in your
body, desperately trying to juggle your responsibilities

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:26.890
at school, your burgeoning sense of young
adulthood, your social life, the looming specter

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:31.620
of the future, and a dozen other things that
might make you stress-sweat through your hoodie.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:37.620
Somehow, in between the classes and extracurriculars,
the standardized tests, and missed party invites,

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.070
you found someone who wants to go out with
you.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:44.050
You’re not sure what they see in you, but
they must see something.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:47.670
Several months into the relationship, you
decide to try and take things to the next

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:48.670
level.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:53.310
You wait for your parents to leave town, you
pick out the perfect Netflix and Chill material,

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:56.010
dim the lights, and cozy up together on the
couch.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:01:00.280
You go in for the kiss, and shockingly, it
goes over well!

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:05.560
Then, just when things are starting to heat
up, something doesn’t feel quite right.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.600
You feel an overwhelming pain wash over your
body, there is a flash of blinding bright

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.850
light that burns into your retinas, and everything
goes black.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:19.330
When you finally wake up, your partner is
gone, only a grisly smear of dark blood remaining,

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:23.270
staining the couch where they sat like some
kind of gory chalk outline.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:30.130
Somehow, you know: they’re gone, they’re
never coming back, and it is all your fault.

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:34.799
It sounds like the opening scene of a horror
film, but for one unfortunate young man known

00:01:34.799 --> 00:01:38.630
as SCP-213, it was all too real.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:44.060
SCP-213 was recovered by the SCP Foundation
in Palo Alto, CA after his arrest.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:49.260
The local police department brought him in
on charges of homicide after he accidentally

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.600
“vaporized” his girlfriend.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:54.869
There were undercover Foundation agents in
the Palo Alto police department who, recognizing

00:01:54.869 --> 00:01:59.280
this case as evidence of an anomaly, made
a report and were ordered to bring the boy

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.909
in for containment.

00:02:00.909 --> 00:02:05.509
During the initial attempts to apprehend 213,
he vaporized the agents as soon as they made

00:02:05.509 --> 00:02:07.520
physical contact with him.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.349
Four agents were lost before 213 could be
successfully brought into a Foundation facility

00:02:12.349 --> 00:02:15.620
where his anomalous properties could be better
studied.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:20.719
SCP-213 is able to sever the bonds between
atoms in any solid matter he comes into physical

00:02:20.719 --> 00:02:21.939
contact with.

00:02:21.939 --> 00:02:27.549
During this process, there is a bright flash
of light, and SCP-213 experiences extreme

00:02:27.549 --> 00:02:30.690
pain, often to the point of passing out.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:35.939
Like most sentient beings in containment,
he is considered a Euclid class SCP.

00:02:35.939 --> 00:02:40.109
SCP-213 was initially contained within a high-security
cell in Site-77.

00:02:40.109 --> 00:02:45.139
The cell is surrounded by a 10-meter-wide
zone pumped full of gasses that are corrosive

00:02:45.139 --> 00:02:46.840
to human skin.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:50.200
SCP-213 was informed of the nature of his
containment.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:54.560
Outside of the containment unit, two armed
guards were stationed with high-pressure hoses,

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:58.639
pepper spray, and polymer web grenades in
case of any escape.

00:02:58.639 --> 00:03:04.409
However, containment of 213 soon proved difficult,
thanks to the nature of his seemingly uncontrollable

00:03:04.409 --> 00:03:05.409
ability.

00:03:05.409 --> 00:03:09.519
213 made seven escape attempts before one
was eventually successful.

00:03:09.519 --> 00:03:14.120
He requested an interview with the researcher
assigned to his case, knowing that, when she

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:19.340
entered his containment facility, the containment
procedures would be temporarily disengaged.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:23.260
He vaporized the remaining containment measures
and escaped from his holding cell.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:27.959
The head researcher attempted to grab him
by the arm, but was promptly vaporized, dissolving

00:03:27.959 --> 00:03:30.209
into a pile of blood and tissue.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:36.010
Two more agents, who tried to block 213’s
path without touching him, met similar fates.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:40.920
After making his way into the hall, 213 quickly
became disoriented, his mind muddled from

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:45.560
a mixture of pain, panic, and lack of familiarity
with the layout of the facility.

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:50.309
He was unable to find an exit and was cornered
in the staff break room, the door barricaded

00:03:50.309 --> 00:03:54.089
with a chair, where he was attempting to vaporize
a portion of the floor.

00:03:54.089 --> 00:03:59.029
At this point, he was too exhausted to disintegrate
any more matter, and collapsed from exhaustion

00:03:59.029 --> 00:04:01.739
just as a group of agents broke down the door.

00:04:01.739 --> 00:04:06.659
He was, with a great deal of care and the
use of a gurney to avoid any unnecessary physical

00:04:06.659 --> 00:04:10.379
contact, returned to his original containment
cell.

00:04:10.379 --> 00:04:13.980
Several weeks later, SCP-213 breached containment
again.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:17.910
However, this time, it was completely unintentional.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:22.590
Security camera footage from 3:15 AM on the
day in question showed 213’s bed and a portion

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:26.660
of the floor vaporize in a flash of light,
after which he fell through the opening in

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.960
the floor and landed in the basement.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:33.790
This incident made it clear that 213 had far
less control over his ability than previously

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:34.790
believed.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:39.020
Rather than a purposefully destructive entity,
he was simply a kid who destroyed what he

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:42.060
touched, and could not do anything about it.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:45.900
If it could happen accidentally this time,
when else could it happen?

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:50.010
Could he, potentially, someday vaporize himself
without meaning to?

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:54.150
Following this containment breach, and some
time to recuperate from the injuries he sustained

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:59.200
from his fall, 213 offered to be more cooperative
with the research into his condition.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:04.180
He agreed to comply with a series of experiments
as well as routine physical examinations,

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:08.520
and whatever else it might take to unlock
the secrets of the vaporization effect.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:13.260
Just like the Foundation, he wanted to know
why he caused this destruction, and how he

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.830
could stop it from happening.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:20.620
During one of the agreed-upon physical examinations,
the research team discovered something concerning.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:25.590
There were smooth nodules, growths of abnormal
tissue, on 213’s back placed in the shape

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:30.270
of a perfect uare, with exactly 15 centimeters
between each one.

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:34.170
The nodules were determined to not be tumors,
or cancerous in any way.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:38.250
They did not seem to cause the subject any
pain, and he could not remember how long they

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.560
had been there.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.180
Perhaps they had been there his entire life.

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.400
Nothing resembling the nodules, or their precise
placement, could be found in any public medical

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.990
records or research journals.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:53.030
It became clear that these strange spots on
213’s back were, likely, somehow related

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:55.330
to his anomalous ability.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:06:00.440
Medical personnel were assigned to monitor
213 in his containment and watch for any changes,

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:04.320
and follow-up examinations were scheduled
to keep an eye on the nodules and any other

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:06.400
potential physical symptoms.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:11.790
A week after the discovery of the first four
nodules, 213 was brought back into the examination

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.970
room for a follow-up inspection.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:17.950
There was nothing new found on the subject’s
back, the original nodules remaining in their

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:21.330
place and exhibiting no change in size or
shape.

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:26.610
However, upon inspection of his hands, the
research team discovered two more nodules.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:30.840
When asked if he was experiencing any pain
or discomfort as a result of these nodules,

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:35.810
213 insisted that he only felt some mild itching
and irritation on the skin around them.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:40.620
A doctor pressed gently on one of the nodules
with his fingertips, and it did not budge.

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:44.880
With the appearance of these additional lumps
on 213’s hands, the research team opted

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.710
to perform a biopsy of one of them and extract
a sample.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:52.830
A local anesthetic was administered to 213’s
left hand, and the doctor attempted to slice

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:55.530
into the surface of the nodule with a scalpel.

00:06:55.530 --> 00:07:00.250
As soon as the scalpel’s blade came into
contact with his skin, there was a sizzling

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:04.920
sound, a blinding flash, and, when the attending
researchers had regained clear vision of the

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.550
room, the scalpel had disappeared.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:13.520
SCP-213 insisted that he had not deliberately
vaporized the scalpel, and offered to try

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.520
again.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:20.070
The second scalpel met the same fate as the
first, as did a third and then a fourth scalpel.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:24.340
After the fifth scalpel disappeared, testing
was suspended for the day and 213 was sent

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:28.160
back to his containment chamber to rest for
the next day’s testing.

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:31.000
From that day on, 213’s demeanor changed.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.960
He was less enthusiastic about continuing
to research his condition, complaining of

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:39.970
a pervasive sense of exhaustion no matter
how much he slept, ate, or hydrated.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:44.440
He complained of extreme pain in his back
and stomach, which did not respond to treatment

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.890
with physical therapy or painkillers.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:52.050
In spite of 213’s newfound apathy, the research
team was determined to persist.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:57.070
They had come this far in their quest to uncover
the mysteries of SCP-213, and they were not

00:07:57.070 --> 00:08:02.130
about to let their subject’s discomfort
- and a few lost scalpels - stop them now.

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:06.580
The plans for another follow-up exam and a
new attempt to perform a biopsy were cut short

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:11.169
when 213 was spotted via security camera having
a seizure in his containment cell.

00:08:11.169 --> 00:08:15.010
He was moved to intensive care and kept there
for further observation.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:19.500
Over the course of the previous 48 hours,
ten more nodules had appeared on his back.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:25.320
Each separated by a distance of 5 centimeters,
the nodules formed no discernible pattern.

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:29.630
Once stabilized, 213 was returned to his cell,
where more medical personnel were stationed

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:34.539
alongside the guards, in order to monitor
his condition and watch for any further seizures

00:08:34.539 --> 00:08:36.680
or other adverse effects.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:43.669
One week later, everything would change, and
the true nature of SCP-213 would finally be

00:08:43.669 --> 00:08:44.669
revealed.

00:08:44.669 --> 00:08:48.930
213 requested his next physical exam, claiming
that he had noticed something wrong with him

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:50.250
while taking a shower.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:55.129
While washing his back, he was shocked to
find the skin suddenly smooth and unblemished.

00:08:55.129 --> 00:08:58.360
The nodules had disappeared, seemingly overnight.

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.170
However, he was more concerned than relieved.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:05.259
He could not shake the feeling that, even
though he could not see it, something worse

00:09:05.259 --> 00:09:06.600
had replaced them.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.260
A cursory examination could not identify anything
in place of the nodules.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:14.170
However, a closer inspection revealed that
there was indeed something there.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:20.319
Where there had once been lumps of tissue,
there were now thin cuts, like surgical incisions,

00:09:20.319 --> 00:09:22.470
less than one millimeter in width.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:26.240
Guards rushed to the examination room when
the sound of a terrified scream echoed through

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.240
the halls.

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:30.680
There, they found the medical examiner, white
as a sheet and trembling.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:35.390
While she had been examining the incisions
on 213’s skin, the one on his left palm

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:37.629
had opened to reveal an eye.

00:09:37.629 --> 00:09:42.290
Though she could not explain how, she knew
that the eye was watching her, that it could

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.970
see what she was doing and wanted to understand
it.

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:50.720
213 was permanently transferred to the medical
wing of the facility, and placed under constant

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:51.920
observation.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:57.759
The appearance of this eye sparked a new hypothesis
among the research team: SCP-213’s anomalous

00:09:57.759 --> 00:09:59.930
properties are not his own.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:02.860
Indeed, his body is not his own either.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:08.470
Some sort of parasite is residing within him,
watching his surroundings through eyes buried

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:09.529
beneath the skin.

00:10:09.529 --> 00:10:15.380
It is vaporizing matter in an attempt to protect
itself from harm, and possibly as a means

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.559
of feeding itself.

00:10:16.559 --> 00:10:22.249
When the eye first appeared, and the parasite
hypothesis was introduced, SCP-213 began to

00:10:22.249 --> 00:10:23.249
panic.

00:10:23.249 --> 00:10:27.300
He begged the research team to remove the
parasite from his body, to cut him open and

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.550
extract it by any means necessary.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:34.829
They refused, and 213 had to be sedated in
order to keep him from attacking any of the

00:10:34.829 --> 00:10:36.279
medical staff.

00:10:36.279 --> 00:10:40.579
Whatever is living inside of 213, it does
not show up on medical scans.

00:10:40.579 --> 00:10:45.959
It cannot, or will not, communicate with the
research team about its nature, or what it

00:10:45.959 --> 00:10:47.100
might want.

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:52.249
The more the medical team tests on it, the
larger it seems to grow, with more and more

00:10:52.249 --> 00:10:57.279
tiny incisions appearing on 213’s body,
through which the entity can look.

00:10:57.279 --> 00:11:02.819
SCP-213 has been placed in a medically induced
coma until the parasitic entity can be better

00:11:02.819 --> 00:11:06.029
understood, and perhaps even removed from
his body.

00:11:06.029 --> 00:11:11.080
In the meantime, perhaps it is better for
him, and every living thing around him, if

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.149
he just stays asleep.

00:11:13.149 --> 00:11:19.220
Now go check out “SCP-426 - I am a Toaster”
and “SCP-999 - The Tickle Monster” if

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:21.850
you’re in the mood for some SCPs that are
more silly than scary!

